---
<Base title="About" description="Shreenija Vadayar is a design engineer and creative technologist who builds things people can touch, wear, use, and experience.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">I’m Shreenija, a design engineer and creative technologist who builds things people can touch, wear, use, and experience.</p>
        <p>I earned a B.S. in Creative Technology &amp; Design from the University of Colorado Boulder, with a minor in Business &amp; Entrepreneurship and a minor in Leadership Studies. My experience spans engineering development, research, prototyping, fabrication, embedded electronics, interactive installations, and visual design.</p>
        <p>I’ve also worked in a production environment at Tecomet, where I supported engineering documentation, inspection, and process improvement alongside Engineering, Manufacturing, and Quality teams.</p>
        <p>I enjoy moving between structured technical problem-solving and open-ended creative exploration, while documenting decisions and refining ideas through iteration.</p>
        <p>I’m interested in opportunities across product development and design engineering, manufacturing and prototyping, creative technology, and creative production.</p>
        <p><a href={url('skills/')}>Skills &amp; credentials</a> · <a href={url('contact/')}>Contact</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
